---@field GestureLeftIdx number Current gesture without the analog fist weight.
---@field GestureRight number Current gesture state of the right hand. Ranges from -1.0 to 6.0 with 0.0 to 1.0 as fist weight.
---@field GestureRightIdx number Current gesture without the analog fist weight.
---@field Grounded boolean Indicates if the player is on the ground.
---@field MovementX number Horizontal movement input value. Ranges from -1.0 to 1.0.
---@field MovementY number Vertical movement input value. Ranges from -1.0 to 1.0.
---@field Prone boolean Indicates if the player is prone.
---@field Sitting boolean Indicates if the player is sitting.
---@field Swimming boolean Indicates if the player is swimming.
---@field Toggle integer Currently selected toggle state. Ranges from 0 to 8.
---@field VisemeIdx integer Index value representing the current viseme. Ranges from 0 to 14.
---@field VisemeLoudness number Loudness level for the current viseme. Ranges from 0.0 to 1.0.

